Here is a **C++ version** of your Python data processing and analysis program, written to replicate the core functionality within **300 lines**. It uses standard C++ libraries and includes **file reading, text preprocessing, sentiment analysis (simplified), deduplication, and basic reporting**. For simplicity, this version does **not include multithreading or PostgreSQL integration**, but it closely mirrors the logic of your Python code.

